      ],
      "text": "Jake is right here asking about a new phone, and I’m still stuck on the fact that he saved me from Marcus without even seeming to realize it. I sent him something I can’t take back, and now I’m waiting to see if he’ll answer or just pretend it never happened. I hate that I care this much, but I’m terrified he’s already decided I’m too much.",
      "tick": 1,
      "timestamp": 1794866940.329643,
      "type": "reflection"
