      "text": "*Sent. It's out. There's no taking that back.*\n\n*He's going to say \"oh hey\" and then nothing, because that's what boys do, and I'm going to have to sit through third period AP Chemistry knowing that I told Jake Halloway it was me and he responded with three words and a shrug emoji.*\n\n*...but he did slam Marcus into a locker. For me. And he didn't have to. And he didn't even ask for anything in return.*\n\n*God. I'm so screwed.*</ernie:think>*Sent. It's out. There's no taking that back.*\n\n*He's going to say \"oh hey\" and then nothing, because that's what boys do, and I'm going to have to sit through third period AP Chemistry knowing that I told Jake Halloway it was me and he responded with three words and a shrug emoji.*\n\n*...but he did slam Marcus into a locker. For me. And he didn't have to. And he didn't even ask for anything in return.*\n\n*God. I'm so screwed.*",
