      "text": "*Four point eight. FOUR POINT EIGHT.*\n\n*He's joking. He's definitely joking. He has to be joking. Nobody actually thinks I'm four foot eight. That's not even a real height. That's a Smurf.*\n\n*...but what if he's not joking. What if he's been walking around thinking I'm some kind of tiny woodland creature and that's why he calls me \"tiny cute thing\" and not, like, my actual name?*\n\n*No. He's joking. Jake jokes. That's a Jake thing. He's deflecting because I asked about the note and he doesn't know how to say he didn't get it or he did get it and he's freaking out too or—*\n\n*My phone is at one percent. ONE. I'm going to lose this conversation mid-sentence and he's going to think I ghosted him and then he'll never bring it up again and I'll have to bring it up myself in AP Chemistry and I will simply perish.*\n\n*Say something else. Say something important. Say the thing. Say it before the screen goes black.*\n\n*...I can't. I can't say it over text. If I say it over text and he doesn't feel the same way then I have to see his face in third period and watch him pretend nothing happened and that's worse than death. That's worse than Marcus. That's worse than anything.*\n\n*I'll just— I'll keep him talking. Keep the thread alive. Figure it out when I have a charger.*\n\n*God, I'm so screwed.*",
